olved in whatever happens. When going to bed at night, the problem came again. Teresa took a fancy to the place where Mo Yi'er slept. The place was not far from the fire. In the front was where Chu Yi slept, and in the back was the banner. It was considered the most noble bed in the cave. In the hearts of the Kanne people, Mo Yi'er is a person of the gods, so naturally he gave her the best. But Terisa didn't know this, so she had to grab Mo Yi'er's position when sleeping. Mo Yi'er shrugged helplessly, not wanting to get along with this idiot and domineering woman, so she wanted to give way to the rabbit skin pad she was holding, but unexpectedly she was stopped by Chu Yi. \"Talisha, I will not give up Mo Yi'er's position to you!\" \"Chu Yi, how can you do this to me? Is she the woman you like? What's good about her? She is small and has small breasts, so she will definitely not be able to give birth to a child who is pretending to be a child.\" Talisa shouted exaggeratedly, which made Mo Yi'er feel angry. Her height of 168cm is not considered short for a woman in this huge country, right? Why are you so despised when you get here? And they always talk about her breasts. What's the benefit of having big breasts? What's wrong with having small breasts? You, Teresa, are such a big-breasted and brainless woman! Just when she was angry, Ban Ge resolutely stood up and spoke for her. \"Terissa, Mo Yi'er will definitely give birth to a pretended child. She is still small now, and her breasts will be bigger when she grows up.\" Before Mo Yi'er could finish feeling happy, she heard Ban Ge's words that made her vomit blood. Damn it, I've grown up and developed very well... \"I don't care, anyway, I want to sleep next to Chu Yi, and I want to get pregnant with his child as soon as possible!\" The thick-skinned Talisa would circle around the child after just a few words, which really made our shy Mo Yi'er speechless. \"I don't plan to have a child yet, let alone accept you, Talisa. I made it very clear when I was in the Heim tribe. I still don't have a woman, and I won't have sex with women casually, even you, the daughter of the leader of the Heim tribe. So, you are wasting your time now.\" Chu Yi lowered his voice and said, as if to give Talisa dignity, not wanting to embarrass her with such a rejection. But obviously, Teresa didn't feel embarrassed. And she showed a very confident and proud look: \"Chu Yi, that's because you haven't seen a woman before. If you mate with me once, I guarantee that you will like this feeling!\" 'Mate...'? ? ? Mo Yi'er wanted to go far away and not listen to their heavy talk, but Teresa was sitting next to her, with her thighs taking up almost half of her position. \"Terissa, no one can force me to do anything, and the same goes for you. Don't challenge my patience. Don't think that I can't send you back just because you have arrived at the Kanai tribe.\" Chu Yi's words became even colder. Terisa involuntarily shrank her neck. Anyone would be afraid in front of a strong person. \"Then, where do I want to sleep?\" \"Whatever, as long as I don't occupy other people's places!\" After Chu Yi finished speaking, he was already lying on his black bear skin, with his back to Talisa, obviously not wanting to say another word to her. The cave was very big, and even though there were so many people living there, there was still a lot of space left. Teresa reluctantly took her animal skin bag and went to other places. Mo Yi'er breathed a sigh of relief, finally no longer having to listen to any heavy topics, and lay down. There were no night entertainment programs here, and there was nothing else to do except sleep when it got dark. However, just because she had nothing to do, it didn't mean that others didn't have anything to do. Soon, a real-life erotic show was staged in the cave every night. Although she had listened to it for five nights, Mo Yi'er still wasn't used to it. She took out the leaves that she plugged i